Hi Giusy,

Please keep the discussion on the list so if anyone else has a 
question like yours, the can see the answers in the archive. First of 
all, you can't use the same design matrix with the rev.Mval object as 
you did with the original MA object because you have reversed the 
order of the reference! Secondly, you should be using eBayes(), not 
ebayes. Thirdly, the p-values from your original modeling with the MA 
object will be exactly the same as what you are trying to do with the 
rev.Mval object. Finally, you should probably try to get help from a 
local statistician or someone else familiar with microarray analysis, 
because IMO you are not quite doing it right, but it's too long and 
complicated to try to say why on e-mail.

Good luck,
Jenny

