From tfrayner at gmail.com  Tue Feb 24 16:24:39 2009
From: tfrayner at gmail.com (Tim Rayner)
Date: Tue, 24 Feb 2009 15:24:39 +0000
Subject: [BioC] GenomeGraphs plot colours (bug?)
